fixture up_strike_no_jump
doc BUILD.md s6 Taper Up row: cancels "Dash from f 4, air attack any frame" (no jump cancel)
room test/flat
frames 30
input
  0 U attack
  2 jump
end
expect
  at 0 action=up
  # The press waits in its 8-frame buffer; the up-strike is 16 frames long, so it expires.
  never 0..29 event.jump=1
end
